notes.body:
I think the variable `prev_pos` should be removed and

    start_msg_tag_cont = curr_pos = prev_pos;

should be changed to

    start_msg_tag_cont = curr_pos;

unless somebody can show us a case, in `nettrace_msg_to_packet()`, where `curr_pos` is set and `prev_pos` is set to a different value than the value to which `cur_pos` is set, or where `prev_pos` is set and `curr_pos` is set to a different value than the value to which `prev_pos` is set.

